  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "FY2025 operating cash flow of $656.2 million [F80] exceeded the $460.5 million net loss [F40], and free cash flow was $437.2 million, a 7.4% margin [F100][D393]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Operating cash flow was driven by the net loss adjusted for $1.0 billion of stock-based compensation and $163.6 million of D&A, plus working-capital timing [P13]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Capex of $219.0 million [F90] was 3.7% of revenue [D392] and 1.34x D&A [D395]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Stock-based compensation of $1,016.8 million [X90] was 155.0% of operating cash flow [D396], so cash generation still depends on a non-cash add-back."}
  ]},
  {"key": "balance_sheet", "title": "Balance sheet and capital allocation", "sentences": [
