    {"type": "comparison", "text": "That is the 0th percentile against an internet peer median of 45.0% net cash of revenue (n=5) [D578][D579], and the current ratio of 3.56x is the window low [F180][D565]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "The FY2025 debt moves were a $1.4 billion repurchase of 2026-2028 notes funded by $1.50 billion of new 2033 Notes [P1][P2]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Buybacks of $750.9 million [X156] were 171.7% of free cash flow [D402], and the diluted share count still rose 2.1% [D425]."}
